  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%A7%8C%EB%85%84-%EC%86%8C%EB%85%84/3579), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62082555)\n\nTen years ago, she appeared 10 years younger than her! Do-kyung, who came down to disband the countryside to catch her ex-husband who broke away. However, here, I meet Seol-oh, who looks the same as my first love. “It may be a day for my sister, but it’s like eternity for me.“ If you open your mouth, you'll be on the plug, and if you wake up, you'll be in front of you. Because of this terrible younger man, Do-kyung was absent from the horn of the scolding 'Gong-ja'... In addition, even my ex-boyfriend Jae-young is starting to circulate around Dogyeong! For my first love, who looks like 20 years old, What happened?",
